Third-party material in this repository

BlendedICU (https://github.com/USM-CHU-FGuyon/BlendedICU; Oliver et al., "Introducing the BlendedICU dataset, the
first harmonized, international intensive care dataset", J Biomed Inform 2023, doi:10.1016/j.jbi.2023.104502). This
repository began as a fork of BlendedICU. Its ETL has since been rewritten and contains no BlendedICU code, but some
mapping tables were first taken from BlendedICU's files and then revised:
- omop_etl/mappings/conditions.csv lists the ICD codes and concepts of BlendedICU's diagnoses.json;
- omop_etl/mappings/drug_ingredients.csv keeps most ingredients of its medications_v11.json with their RxNorm concept
  ids; the matching patterns and the further ingredients are ours;
- omop_etl/mappings/mimic4/drug_units.csv follows its MIMIC-IV dose-unit conversions;
- the variable names in omop_etl/mappings/*/measurements.csv, and some source items (ventilator settings, several
  eICU items, some HiRID variables), follow its timeseries_variables.csv; their concepts follow OHDSI's MIMIC-IV ETL,
  and most items ricu's concept dictionary.
