YAIB-cohorts (https://github.com/rvandewater/YAIB-cohorts). The antibiotic sets of cohorts/abx_sets.py are those
of the abx_duration concept of its ricu extensions (ricu-extensions/configs/medications/concept-dict.json), and the
KDIGO and urine-rate rules that cohorts/ reproduces are those of its callbacks (ricu-extensions/callbacks). Under
